+# Accounts Service
+
+Terms used by the multi-tenant customer accounts and support-case domain.
+
+## Language
+
+**Support case**:
+A customer issue raised about one of their accounts and handled by a support user.
+_Avoid_: ticket, request
+
+**Assignee**:
+The support user currently responsible for handling a support case.
+_Avoid_: owner, handler
+
+**Support assignment**:
+The tenant-scoped relationship that authorizes a support user to work on a specific account.
+_Avoid_: case assignment
+
+**Tenant**:
+An individual bank and the boundary for its customers, accounts, staff, and support cases.
+_Avoid_: organization, bank account
